p://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4114693875417888971/comments/default/25088262424709540'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/we-do-not-need-you-blue-supremacist.html?showComment=1442749559585#c25088262424709540' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/we-do-not-need-you-blue-supremacist.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4114693875417888971' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4114693875417888971' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1603764547"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 20, 2015 at 5:45 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7949144351338160357</id><published>2015-09-18T10:41:05.506-06:00</published><updated>2015-09-18T10:41:05.506-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Great article Will ! If only unionized government ...</title><content type='html'>Great article Will ! If only unionized government monopoly security workers would all quit !  Residents of municipalities could  then choose from competing private enterprise rights protection services. Residents would have total consumer control over their security.  Security in municipalities would quickly come to resemble the amiable and helpful security of the shopping mall, what amounts to the private town.&lt;br /&gt;And  as if to illustrate the point, there was a recent incident at a Whole Foods grocery store remarkably similar to the body slamming suffered by James Blake at the hands of an NYPD thug. The difference is while Blake&amp;#39;s assailant is still on the NYPD payroll Whole Foods quickly fired the security guard who assaulted one of its customers and within days replaced the security firm employing him entirely.  </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4114693875417888971/comments/default/7949144351338160357'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4114693875417888971/comments/default/7949144351338160357'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/we-do-not-need-you-blue-supremacist.html?showComment=1442594465506#c7949144351338160357' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/we-do-not-need-you-blue-supremacist.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4114693875417888971' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4114693875417888971' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1580815317"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 18, 2015 at 10:41 AM"/></entry></feed>